```
export type MarkdownStyle = {
  syntax: TextStyle;
  link: TextStyle;
  h1: TextStyle;
  ...
  blockquote: TextStyle;
  ...
}
```
And on web, the library applies these to spans. `borderWidth` may cause layout shift.

